==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|upset|t=the act of setting up; establishment}}, from {{der|en|enm|upsetten}}, corresponding to {{af|en|up-|set}}. Cognate with {{cog|gml|upset|t=setup; arrangement}}.

